comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T23:30:21.199Z",codex-agent,"Companion specification: pm-cli-website-7u0d (read only). Plan: immutable request declarations, SDK revision-guarded task state, durable send intent and conservative uncertainty recovery. Local package only; no release or remote writes."
  "2026-10-28T23:48:52.037Z",codex-agent,"Measured ten-request proof: 10 historical observations, 2 unauthenticated public calls plus 8 fixture calls, 103388 captured body bytes (25847 estimated tokens), 784-token difference packet, zero omitted packet rows, 90 header redactions, 36861 ms including SDK setup and recording. Scratch non-git tracker removed. Final packet numbers will be refreshed after timing-difference admission."
  "2026-10-28T23:59:50.819Z",codex-agent,In-process native host acceptance passed 12/12. Coverage instrumentation exposed a too-short lock admission wait in simultaneous sends; extended the bounded wait and added per-key process admission queues while retaining native SDK leases and CAS for separate processes. A suspected SDK lock publication defect did not reproduce with the public lease API; it is not reported as an SDK bug.
  "2026-10-29T01:53:50.680Z",codex-agent,"Resume verification: native CLI privacy and independent-process contention acceptance each passed 1/1. CLI expected-error recovery uses a supported sanitized payload rather than echoing request arguments. Completed 13 behavioral safety/concurrency reverts; added host-error privacy as a fourteenth proof. Packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx journeys passed 2/2. Final release gates follow the implementation commit."
